    "detailed_description": "<h1>A CINEMATIC SPACE SHOOTER - WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Edge of Reality is an interactive visual novel.<br><br>It seems that there can be no more boring profession in the world than an appraiser in a pawnshop. But meeting with a mysterious young lady brings one such appraiser through a series of strange events, changing Dan\u2019s initial perspective about his craft. In this game, immerse yourself in an intricate story, where dreams and reality are intertwined into a single whole. Where, at some point, reality itself may lose its stability.<br><br><strong>Feature of game: </strong><br>- Non-linear passage, and unexpected plot twists; <br>- Unique visual style; <br>- Music written specifically for this game, allows you to fully convey the atmosphere.<br><br>If you study one of the suggested languages, you have the opportunity to test your skills in the game. A unique additional bilingual reading mode will help you to have both fun and profit. You can assign any pair of languages available in the game.<br><br>Edge of Reality is a mystery story dictated by logical deduction. Its completion depends on your choices, and yours alone.",
    "about_the_game": "Edge of Reality is an interactive visual novel.<br><br>It seems that there can be no more boring profession in the world than an appraiser in a pawnshop. But meeting with a mysterious young lady brings one such appraiser through a series of strange events, changing Dan\u2019s initial perspective about his craft. In this game, immerse yourself in an intricate story, where dreams and reality are intertwined into a single whole. Where, at some point, reality itself may lose its stability.<br><br><strong>Feature of game: </strong><br>- Non-linear passage, and unexpected plot twists; <br>- Unique visual style; <br>- Music written specifically for this game, allows you to fully convey the atmosphere.<br><br>If you study one of the suggested languages, you have the opportunity to test your skills in the game. A unique additional bilingual reading mode will help you to have both fun and profit. You can assign any pair of languages available in the game.<br><br>Edge of Reality is a mystery story dictated by logical deduction. Its completion depends on your choices, and yours alone.",
    "short_description": "It seems that there can be no more boring profession in the world than a pawnshop appraiser. But a meeting with a mysterious but pretty stranger changes Dan's idea of his job.",
